This is a brilliant design update. The pill-shaped steps with the text inside (exactly as shown in **1000117186.jpg**) provide a much more modern, tracking-style interface for the detailed modal.
To achieve this without breaking your mini-stepper in the grid, we will create a dedicated BigWorkflowIcon and BigConnector just for the modal. We will move the Stage Name inside the pill, while keeping the Role Chip and Pending Time directly below it, exactly as you requested.
Here are the precise changes to make to your JournalAuthorization.jsx file:
### 1. Add the Custom Styles for the Big Stepper
Paste this code right below your existing CustomConnector and CustomWorkflowIcon (around line 125, outside of the main component function).
```javascript
// --- BIG STEPPER STYLES (For Modal Only, based on 1000117186.jpg) ---
const BigConnector = styled(StepConnector)(({ theme }) => ({
  [`&.${stepConnectorClasses.alternativeLabel}`]: {
    top: 20, // Center of the 40px tall pill
    left: 'calc(-50% + 80px)', // Offset by half the width of the 160px pill
    right: 'calc(50% + 80px)',
  },
  [`&.${stepConnectorClasses.active}`]: {
    [`& .${stepConnectorClasses.line}`]: { borderColor: theme.palette.success.main },
  },
  [`&.${stepConnectorClasses.completed}`]: {
    [`& .${stepConnectorClasses.line}`]: { borderColor: theme.palette.success.main },
  },
  [`& .${stepConnectorClasses.line}`]: {
    borderColor: theme.palette.divider,
    borderTopWidth: 3,
    borderRadius: 1,
  },
}));

const BigWorkflowIcon = (props) => {
  const { statusFlag, label } = props;

  const baseStyle = {
    height: 40,
    minWidth: 160,
    borderRadius: 20, // Pill shape
    display: 'flex',
    alignItems: 'center',
    justifyContent: 'center',
    gap: 1,
    px: 2,
    position: 'relative',
    zIndex: 2,
    backgroundColor: 'white'
  };

  // Info/Escalation Badge (Top Right)
  const InfoBadge = () => (
    <Box sx={{
      position: 'absolute', top: -4, right: -4, width: 18, height: 18, borderRadius: '50%',
      backgroundColor: 'warning.main', color: 'white', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center',
      justifyContent: 'center', fontSize: '11px', fontWeight: 'bold', border: '2px solid white'
    }}>
      !
    </Box>
  );

  if (statusFlag === 'COMPLETED') {
    return (
      <Box sx={{ ...baseStyle, border: '2px solid', borderColor: 'success.main', backgroundColor: '#e8f5e9', color: 'success.main' }}>
        <CheckIcon sx={{ fontSize: 18 }} />
        <Typography variant="body2" fontWeight="bold">{label}</Typography>
      </Box>
    );
  }
  if (statusFlag === 'REJECTED') {
    return (
      <Box sx={{ ...baseStyle, border: '2px solid', borderColor: 'error.main', backgroundColor: '#ffebee', color: 'error.main' }}>
        <CloseIcon sx={{ fontSize: 18 }} />
        <Typography variant="body2" fontWeight="bold">{label}</Typography>
      </Box>
    );
  }
  if (statusFlag === 'ESCALATED' || statusFlag === 'ACTIVE') {
    return (
      <Box sx={{ ...baseStyle, border: '2px solid', borderColor: 'warning.main', color: 'text.primary' }}>
        <Typography variant="body2" fontWeight="bold">{label}</Typography>
        <InfoBadge />
      </Box>
    );
  }
  
  // PENDING / FUTURE STEPS (Gray outline)
  return (
    <Box sx={{ ...baseStyle, border: '2px solid #e2e8f0', color: 'text.disabled' }}>
      <Typography variant="body2" fontWeight="bold">{label}</Typography>
    </Box>
  );
};

```
### 2. Update the Big Stepper inside the View Modal
Now we swap out the old components for the new ones, and remove the text label that used to render below the circle (since it is now inside the pill). The Role Chip and Pending Time remain untouched below it.
**FIND the <!-- HORIZONTAL TIMELINE --> section in your Modal (around line 730) and REPLACE the <Stepper> block with this:**
```javascript
                  <Stepper
                    activeStep={
                      (viewingBatchState === "POSTED" || viewingBatchState === "SCHEDULED" || viewingBatchState === "APPROVED")
                        ? dynamicSteps.length
                        : dynamicSteps.findIndex(s => s.state === viewingBatchState)
                    }
                    alternativeLabel
                    connector={<BigConnector />} // <-- Using new BigConnector
                  >
                    {dynamicSteps.map((step, index) => {
                      const isFullyDone = viewingBatchState === "POSTED" || viewingBatchState === "SCHEDULED" || viewingBatchState === "APPROVED";
                      const activeStepIndex = isFullyDone ? dynamicSteps.length : dynamicSteps.findIndex(s => s.state === viewingBatchState);

                      const isCompleted = index < activeStepIndex;
                      const isCurrent = index === activeStepIndex;

                      // Escalation Calculation
                      const escalationHours = viewingBatch?.escalationTime || 24;
                      const hoursPending = viewingBatch ? Math.abs(new Date() - new Date(viewingBatch.requestDate)) / 36e5 : 0;
                      const isEscalated = viewingBatchState !== "REJECTED" && (activeStepIndex < dynamicSteps.length) && (hoursPending > escalationHours);

                      let statusFlag = 'PENDING';
                      if (isCompleted) statusFlag = 'COMPLETED';
                      if (isCurrent && viewingBatchState === "REJECTED") statusFlag = 'REJECTED';
                      else if (isCurrent && isEscalated) statusFlag = 'ESCALATED';
                      else if (isCurrent) statusFlag = 'ACTIVE';

                      return (
                        <Step key={step.state} completed={isCompleted} active={isCurrent} sx={{ opacity: (viewingBatchState === "REJECTED" && index > activeStepIndex) ? 0.3 : 1 }}>
                          
                          {/* Using new BigWorkflowIcon and passing the label inside it */}
                          <StepLabel StepIconComponent={() => <BigWorkflowIcon statusFlag={statusFlag} label={step.designation} />}>
                            
                            {/* The Role Chip directly below the pill */}
                            <Chip
                              label={getRoleDisplayName(step.role)}
                              size="small"
                              variant={isCurrent ? "filled" : "outlined"}
                              color={isCurrent ? "primary" : "default"}
                              sx={{ mt: 1, height: 22, fontSize: "0.65rem", fontWeight: "bold" }}
                            />

                            {/* The Pending Time below the Chip */}
                            {isCurrent && viewingBatchState !== "REJECTED" && (
                              <Typography variant="caption" display="block" color={isEscalated ? "warning.main" : "text.secondary"} fontWeight="bold" sx={{ mt: 1 }}>
                                Pending: {calculateTimeElapsed(viewingBatch?.requestDate)}
                              </Typography>
                            )}
                          </StepLabel>
                        </Step>
                      );
                    })}
                  </Stepper>

